  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Structure of Lactose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><img src=\"assets\\st0090_71b9c93e57a2.png\" style=\"width: 530px; height: 227px;\" /></p><p>The linkage is between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>-Galactose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>-Glucose.</p>"
